Dear Mr. Smykowski:                                                         
                                                                            
Thank you for your question about the new cover sheets. Every TPS           
report now goes out with a cover sheet, so that each report can be          
traced to the person who prepared it and the date it was sent.              
                                                                            
The cover sheets are in the supply room on the third floor. If you          
need more than a few, ask Milton Waddams in collating, who keeps            
the reserve stock.                                                          
                                                                            
Sincerely,                                                                  
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
Bill Lumbergh                                                               
Vice President                                                              
                                                                            
